{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38912","headline":"赠题兜率寺闲上人院 · 杜荀鹤","name":"赠题兜率寺闲上人院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人间寺应诸天号，真行僧禅此寺中。\n百岁有涯头上雪，万般无染耳边风。\n挂帆波浪惊心白，上马尘埃翳眼红。\n毕竟浮生谩劳役，算来何事不成空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}